    <body>
      <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)" source="#source-256-271"><seg source="#source-256-271">×</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-271-294"><seg source="#source-271-294">えこそ忘れめや</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-294-332"><seg source="#source-294-332">そのくちづけのあとやさき</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-332-364"><seg source="#source-332-364">流るる水をせき止めし</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-364-401"><seg source="#source-364-401">わかれの際の青き月の出</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)" source="#source-401-416"><seg source="#source-401-416">×</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-416-445"><seg source="#source-416-445">雨落し來らんとして</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-445-474"><seg source="#source-445-474">沖につばなの花咲き</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-474-527"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-474-495"><rb>海月</rb><rt>くらげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-495-527">は渚にきて青く光れり</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-527-574"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-527-545"><rb>砂丘</rb><rt>をか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-545-574">に登りて遠きを望む</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-574-600"><seg source="#source-574-600">いま我が身の上に</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-600-636"><seg source="#source-600-636">好しと思ふことのありけり</seg></p>
    </body>
